# w2_truss_fem.struct -- written from workloads/w2_truss_fem.m and DESIGN.md 2.14.9; never from the
# Sea output. Panel 0's 602 lines are 2 x nElem, nElem = 2 nPanel + (nPanel + 1) + 2 nPanel = 301
# for nPanel = 60 (script lines 22, 52-65).
file output/w2_truss_fem.svg
canvas 960 720
heading W2 truss
panels 3
panel 0
title~ Deformed shape \(x[0-9]+\), red tension, blue compression
xlabel x [m]
ylabel y [m]
ylabel2 -
count line 602
count legend 0
panel 1
title Load-angle sweep
xlabel Load angle [deg]
ylabel [-]
ylabel2 -
count line 2
legend max utilisation
legend 1 / min FOS
panel 2
title Single-member removal
xlabel Removed member
ylabel Max utilisation
ylabel2 -
count bars 1
count legend 0
